# Planning gate

Before non-trivial code, state: Spec/card, engineering rules (`AGENTS.md` + `agent_index.md`), ADRs, and Risk tier.
If any is missing or ambiguous: **stop and ask — do not infer.**
Prefer Plan Mode for multi-chip or cross-cutting work; get sign-off before writing production code.
Auto-card first when the request is new implementation without a covering card.
